Home Manager installs skills as symlinks, but this filter drops every symlinked
entry before isMarkdownFile ever sees it, so symlinked SKILL.md files are
silently skipped. Removing the isSymbolicLink guard lets them load;
loadSkillFromPath already resolves the target.

Retargeted from packages/omo-opencode/src/features/opencode-skill-loader/, which
upstream reduced to a one-line re-export when the loader moved into
skills-loader-core. The old sed matched nothing there and had become a no-op.

--- a/packages/skills-loader-core/src/features/opencode-skill-loader/skill-directory-loader.ts
+++ b/packages/skills-loader-core/src/features/opencode-skill-loader/skill-directory-loader.ts
@@ -49,7 +49,6 @@
     (entry) =>
       !entry.name.startsWith(".") &&
       !entry.isDirectory() &&
-      !entry.isSymbolicLink() &&
       isMarkdownFile(entry)
   )
 
